## Patches

`patches/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/*` contains modified copies of official
DeepSeek Harness packages (image inbound bridging, preset-selection semantics
fix). They are derived from the official packages; see
`patches/README.md` for the re-apply checklist. They may break when the
harness version changes.

